      "content": "i don't really know why i'm talking to an ai about this but here i am i guess. my best friend died eight months ago. she took her own life. and i've been doing ok, like holding it together for her family and our friend group, being the strong one. but lately i keep thinking about her and why she did it and... i don't know. i think i understand it more than i should. more than i want to.",
