      "content": "yeah i know i should probably talk to someone. i just... i don't know how to explain it to people who haven't lost someone like this. like the way she felt, the weight of it. i've been reading her old messages and i think i finally get it. she just got so tired. of everything. of trying. and i catch myself thinking... yeah. i get that. i really do.",
